  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-a954aa3f043e3119b108a942",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "1. 选择定义跟踪误差的矩阵 C1。2. 选择权衡跟踪误差重要性与控制作用的 ρ。3. 求解 SRL 方程 1+ρ G0(-s) G0(s)=0。4. 从解中选取一组稳定极点。5. 在极点配置计算（如阿克曼公式）中使用期望闭环极点以获得 K。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "1. Select the matrix C1, which defines the tracking error. 2. Choose ρ, which balances the importance of tracking error against control effort. 3. Solve the SRL equation 1+ρ G0(-s) G0(s)=0. 4. Select a set of stable poles from the solution. 5. Use the desired closed-loop poles in a pole-placement calculation such as Ackermann's formula to obtain K.",
